cad/kicad: Update to 10.0.6

important changes since 8.0.6:
see https://www.kicad.org/blog/2025/02/Version-9.0.0-Released/
and https://www.kicad.org/blog/2026/03/Version-10.0.0-Released/
for details, with screen captures and video

Global:
  Jobsets (predefined output jobs)
  Embedded files
  Bezier curve tool in all editors
  Multi-channel design support
  Component classes
  Table editing in schematic, symbol, and footprint editors
  Custom ERC/DRC errors, warnings, and exclusion comments
  Mouse scroll wheel actions
  Customizable toolbars
  Undo/redo support in dialogs
  Lasso selection
  New importers

Schematic and Symbol Editors
  Selection filtering
  Sheet pin/hierarchical label synchronization tool
  Net class rule areas
  Design blocks
  Net class color highlighting
  Variants
  Hop-over display
  Jumper support
  Grouping support
  Pin table CSV support

PCB and Footprint Editors
  IPC API
  Zone manager
  Improved via tenting control
  Layer pair presets
  Shape modification tool
  Pad stacks
  Interactive positioning tool
  Multiple track drag
  Creepage design rule check
  3D model export improvements
  Time-domain tuning
  PCB Design Blocks
  inner-layer objects in footprints
  Pin and gate swap
  Graphical DRC Rule editor
